_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJH64Mqs22EepWQxbny6YmJGyZwmP1ReF82tRJkJ98pQ&oe=6AEA127E"}, {"file_name": "vote-screenshot-2-booth-right-2026-10-29-v1.png", "id": "1314870544051298", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313110_1314870547384631_2103931933701747364_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=28ZS7ZVogXMQ7kNvwGelVt0&_nc_oc=AdqhbZ1jjGc1Dls6UFE1DWgrAi33pevPS1MY2HBp3Dbd-gsqOlq3grAKk_SLzle9a3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCfEDviLqeiBIo0IT5c3Ajr1oksCERXufZFoK_UcoJnQ&oe=6AE9FDFA"}, {"file_name": "vote-screenshot-3-control-panel-2026-10-29-v1.png", "id": "4514389555539920", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613039514_4514389562206586_52418733781122788_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFpoeR2UsKUQ7kNvwHJRfSd&_nc_oc=Ado2TZfFS8rE5WUtWVIqzBd8PJ44edTyJPbDAJAhA_Ufgp7fwQagiAVLlvw8x66jXzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScXN2zoqDiDTtq8PicBngQpMwlaI-EAuyNPGTVu2DaKg&oe=6AEA0448"}, {"file_name": "vote-screenshot-4-process-button-2026-10-29-v1.png", "id": "2693278024422242", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/747795579_2693278027755575_6330010770799350555_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ewjmRgcbgiQQ7kNvwHNO0mA&_nc_oc=Adr62GQ7SDF3Lx9VbQb0_4SYnkc0bdKWT_bUgZRvrWztId94KGHQlTmFSjsG2byo8B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSp6-LskU0rCYKmKLPWpM_jU_83PNvy1HsN22IijJG-Rg&oe=6AE9F763"}, {"file_name": "vote-screenshot-5-cast-vote-2026-10-29-v1.png", "id": "39552621074385272", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604306524_39552621081051938_5181060268971124086_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5pC1n5XXFh8Q7kNvwEi-Mla&_nc_oc=AdqlT2Jph9vZMJoYoKTyDueflx8p8BftyYvA_genkmeG7V_U1sif6KmnhtrjWyoCYrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4VU-RWkSg09Io2aq-oK1xF5wzbYPSCTY6VgkGYqwpsw&oe=6AE9F074"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vote-trailer-thumbnail-2026-10-29-v1.png", "id": "1068069522940387", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_1068069526273720_6782637314276097853_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EtfzwF2NGPcQ7kNvwHCIBq8&_nc_oc=Adrleatg9UukMK8sRKz2S6WzLf03qktU728oul8qMcBBiaBZfYlC8GH_AyaSbrhAiX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQyZ-CwznbCxyWy4akbqwG3wtFi_vSLEJrRzc73FhdTw&oe=6AE9E604"}, "display_name": "Vote", "keywords": ["vote", "voting", "poll", "debate", "simulator"], "long_description": "# BIG THINGS ARE IN STORE\n\nVote is gearing up for its next chapter! A major update is in the works for the coming months, with fresh polls and new head-to-head questions. Stay tuned \u2014 what's in store is worth the wait.\n\n# CAST YOUR VOTE\n\nStep into Vote, the free VR voting simulator for Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S and Pro. Whatever the question, pick your side, cast your ballot, and track real-time results as people around the world vote with you. It's not just sports \u2014 it's all sorts of things. Make your voice count!\n\nAll eligible votes can claim a free game discount code at the end of the experience.\n\nKey Features:\n- Vote on head-to-head questions on all sorts of topics\n- Track real-time voting results from around the world\n- Immersive VR visuals to enhance the experience\n- Free on Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S and Pro\n\n# WHILE YOU WAIT, TRY OUR OTHER WORLDS\n\nFace the haunted chapters of **Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)**, or team up against an evolving alien in **BlackGate**, our 4v1 multiplayer horror game. Find both from Fun Train on the Meta Quest store.\n\nThis is a virtual voting simulator and is not an official voting platform. Votes cast in 'Vote' do not have any standing in the real-world . 'Vote' is a product of Megaverse LLC, a Fun Train company. All rights reserved. \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC. Unauthorized use, duplication, or distribution of this material without express and written permission from Megaverse LLC is strictly prohibited.", "short_description": "Something big is in store for Vote! A major update is in the works for the coming months, with fresh polls and new head-to-head questions on all sorts of topics. Stay tuned \u2014 and until then, step in, pick a side, cast your vote, and watch real-time results roll in!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1825978985104864", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vote", "keywords": ["abstimmung", "umfrage", "debatte", "wahl", "simulator"], "long_description": "# GROSSES STEHT BEVOR\n\nVote bereitet sein n\u00e4chstes Kapitel vor! Ein gro\u00dfes Update ist f\u00fcr die kommenden Monate in Arbeit \u2013 mit frischen Umfragen und Kopf-an-Kopf-Fragen. Bleib dran: Das Warten lohnt sich.\n\n# GIB DEINE STIMME AB\n\nBetritt Vote, den kostenlosen VR-Abstimmungssimulator f\u00fcr Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S und Pro. W\u00e4hle deine Seite, gib deine Stimme ab und verfolge die Ergebnisse in Echtzeit, w\u00e4hrend weltweit Menschen mit dir abstimmen. Es geht nicht nur um Sport \u2013 es geht um alles M\u00f6gliche. Lass deine Stimme z\u00e4hlen!\n\nBerechtigte Stimmen erhalten am Ende einen kostenlosen Rabattcode f\u00fcr ein Spiel.\n\nHauptmerkmale:\n- Kopf-an-Kopf-Fragen zu allen m\u00f6glichen Themen\n- Verfolge Abstimmungsergebnisse aus aller Welt in Echtzeit\n- Immersive VR-Grafik f\u00fcr besseres Erlebnis\n- Kostenlos f\u00fcr Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S und Pro\n\n# W\u00c4HREND DU WARTEST: ENTDECKE UNSERE ANDEREN WELTEN\n\nStelle dich den Spukkapiteln von **Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)** oder k\u00e4mpfe im Team gegen ein entwickelndes Alien in **BlackGate**, unserem 4v1-Horrorspiel. Beide von Fun Train, im Meta Quest Store.\n\nDies ist ein virtueller Abstimmungssimulator und keine offizielle Wahlplattform. In 'Vote' abgegebene Stimmen sind in der realen Welt ung\u00fcltig. 'Vote' ist ein Produkt von Megaverse LLC, einem Fun Train Unternehmen. Alle Rechte vorbehalten. \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC. Nutzung, Vervielf\u00e4ltigung oder Verbreitung dieses Materials ohne ausdr\u00fcckliche schriftliche Genehmigung von Megaverse LLC sind streng untersagt.", "short_description": "Bei Vote steht Gro\u00dfes bevor! Ein gro\u00dfes Update ist f\u00fcr die kommenden Monate in Arbeit, mit frischen Umfragen und neuen Kopf-an-Kopf-Fragen zu allen m\u00f6glichen Themen. Bleib dran \u2013 und bis dahin: Steig ein, w\u00e4hle deine Seite, gib deine Stimme ab und verfolge die Ergebnisse in Echtzeit!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1807059740488162", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vote", "keywords": ["voto", "encuesta", "debate", "elecciones", "simulador"], "long_description": "# GRANDES NOVEDADES EN CAMINO\n\nVote prepara su pr\u00f3ximo cap\u00edtulo: una gran actualizaci\u00f3n llega en los pr\u00f3ximos meses, con encuestas y preguntas cara a cara. Mantente atento: lo que viene vale la pena.\n\n# EMITE TU VOTO\n\nEntra en Vote, el simulador de votaci\u00f3n VR gratuito para Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S y Pro. Sea cual sea la pregunta, elige tu bando, emite tu voto y sigue los resultados en tiempo real mientras el mundo vota contigo. No es solo deporte: es de todo. \u00a1Haz que tu voz cuente!\n\nLos votos v\u00e1lidos pueden reclamar un c\u00f3digo de descuento gratuito para un juego al final de la experiencia.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas principales:\n- Vota en preguntas cara a cara sobre todo tipo de temas\n- Sigue los resultados en tiempo real de todo el mundo\n- Gr\u00e1ficos VR inmersivos que mejoran la experiencia\n- Gratis en Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S y Pro\n\n# MIENTRAS ESPERAS, PRUEBA NUESTROS OTROS MUNDOS\n\nEnfr\u00e9ntate a los cap\u00edtulos embrujados de **Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)** o forma equipo contra un alien\u00edgena en evoluci\u00f3n en **BlackGate**, nuestro juego de terror multijugador 4 contra 1 de Fun Train. Encu\u00e9ntralos en la tienda de Meta Quest.\n\nEste es un simulador de votaci\u00f3n virtual, no una plataforma de votaci\u00f3n oficial. Los votos en 'Vote' no tienen validez en el mundo real. 'Vote' es un producto de Megaverse LLC, empresa de Fun Train. Todos los derechos reservados. \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC. Sin permiso expreso y por escrito de Megaverse LLC, est\u00e1 prohibido usar, duplicar o distribuir este material.", "short_description": "\u00a1Vote se prepara para algo grande! Una gran actualizaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 en camino para los pr\u00f3ximos meses, con nuevas encuestas y preguntas cara a cara sobre todo tipo de temas. Mantente atento: mientras tanto, entra, elige tu bando, emite tu voto y mira c\u00f3mo llegan los resultados en tiempo real."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1796792478203149", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vote", "keywords": ["\ud22c\ud45c", "\uc5ec\ub860\uc870\uc0ac", "\ud1a0\ub860", "\uc120\uac70", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\ud130"], "long_description": "# \ud070 \ubcc0\ud654\uac00 \ub2e4\uac00\uc624\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4\n\nVote\uac00 \ub2e4\uc74c \uc7a5\uc744 \uc900\ube44\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc55e\uc73c\ub85c \uba87 \ub2ec \uc548\uc5d0 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud22c\ud45c\uc640 \uc591\uc790\ud0dd\uc77c \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \ub2f4\uc740 \ub300\ud615 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uac00 \uc608\uc815\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uae30\ub300\ud574 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694. \uae30\ub2e4\ub9b4 \uac00\uce58\uac00 \uc788\ub294 \ub0b4\uc6a9\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n# \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ud55c \ud45c\ub97c \ud589\uc0ac\ud558\uc138\uc694\n\nMeta Quest 2, 3, 3S, Pro\uc6a9 \ubb34\ub8cc VR \ud22c\ud45c \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\ud130 Vote\uc5d0 \uc785\uc7a5\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc774\ub4e0 \ud3b8\uc744 \uace0\ub974\uace0, \ud22c\ud45c\ud558\uace0, \uc804 \uc138\uacc4 \uc0ac\ub78c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8\ud558\ub294 \uc2e4\uc2dc\uac04 \uacb0\uacfc\ub97c \ud655\uc778\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uc2a4\ud3ec\uce20\ub9cc\uc774 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc628\uac16 \uc8fc\uc81c\uac00 \ub300\uc0c1\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubaa9\uc18c\ub9ac\ub97c \ub0b4\uc138\uc694!\n\n\uc790\uaca9\uc744 \uac16\ucd98 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ud22c\ud45c\ub294 \uccb4\ud5d8 \uc885\ub8cc \uc2dc \ubb34\ub8cc \uac8c\uc784 \ud560\uc778 \ucf54\ub4dc\ub97c \ubc1b\uc744 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc8fc\uc694 \ud2b9\uc9d5:\n- \uc628\uac16 \uc8fc\uc81c\uc758 \uc591\uc790\ud0dd\uc77c \uc9c8\ubb38\uc5d0 \ud22c\ud45c\n- \uc804 \uc138\uacc4\uc5d0\uc11c \ubaa8\uc774\ub294 \ud22c\ud45c \uacb0\uacfc\ub97c \uc2e4\uc2dc\uac04\uc73c\ub85c \ud655\uc778\n- \uccb4\ud5d8\uc744 \ud55c\uce35 \ub192\uc5ec \uc8fc\ub294 \ubab0\uc785\uac10 \uc788\ub294 VR \ube44\uc8fc\uc5bc\n- Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S, Pro\uc5d0\uc11c \ubb34\ub8cc\n\n# \uae30\ub2e4\ub9ac\ub294 \ub3d9\uc548, \ub2e4\ub978 \uc138\uacc4\ub3c4 \ub9cc\ub098 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694\n\n**Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)**\uc758 \uc800\uc8fc\ubc1b\uc740 \ucc55\ud130\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc804\ud558\uac70\ub098, 4\ub3001 \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc5b4 \ud638\ub7ec \uac8c\uc784 **BlackGate**\uc5d0\uc11c \uc9c4\ud654\ud558\ub294 \uc5d0\uc77c\ub9ac\uc5b8\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c \ud300\uc744 \uc774\ub904 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694. \ub450 \uac8c\uc784 \ubaa8\ub450 Fun Train\uc758 \uc791\ud488\uc73c\ub85c Meta Quest \uc2a4\ud1a0\uc5b4\uc5d0\uc11c \ub9cc\ub098\uc2e4 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\ubcf8 \uc571\uc740 \uac00\uc0c1\uc758 \ud22c\ud45c \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\ud130\uc774\uba70 \uacf5\uc2dd \ud22c\ud45c \ud50c\ub7ab\ud3fc\uc774 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4. 'Vote'\uc5d0\uc11c \ud589\uc0ac\ub41c \ud45c\ub294 \ud604\uc2e4 \uc138\uacc4\uc5d0\uc11c \uc5b4\ub5a0\ud55c \ud6a8\ub825\ub3c4 \uac16\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 'Vote'\ub294 Fun Train\uc758 \ud68c\uc0ac\uc778 Megaverse LLC\uc758 \uc81c\ud488\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uad8c\ub9ac \ubcf4\uc720. \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC. Megaverse LLC\uc758 \uba85\uc2dc\uc801\uc778 \uc11c\uba74 \ud5c8\uac00 \uc5c6\uc774 \ubcf8 \uc790\ub8cc\ub97c \ubb34\ub2e8\uc73c\ub85c \uc0ac\uc6a9, \ubcf5\uc81c \ub610\ub294 \ubc30\ud3ec\ud558\ub294 \uac83\uc740 \uc5c4\uaca9\ud788 \uae08\uc9c0\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.", "short_description": "Vote\uc5d0 \ud070 \ubcc0\ud654\uac00 \ub2e4\uac00\uc624\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc55e\uc73c\ub85c \uba87 \ub2ec \uc548\uc5d0 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud22c\ud45c\uc640 \uc628\uac16 \uc8fc\uc81c\uc758 \uc591\uc790\ud0dd\uc77c \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \ub2f4\uc740 \ub300\ud615 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uac00 \uc900\ube44 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uae30\ub300\ud574 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694. \uadf8\ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0\ub294 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud574\uc11c \ud3b8\uc744 \uace0\ub974\uace0, \ud22c\ud45c\ud558\uace0, \uc2e4\uc2dc\uac04\uc73c\ub85c \uc9d1\uacc4\ub418\ub294 \uacb0\uacfc\ub97c \uc9c0\ucf1c\ubcf4\uc138\uc694!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1111520088394167", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vote", "keywords": ["voto", "encuesta", "debate", "elecciones", "simulador"], "long_description": "# GRANDES NOVEDADES EN CAMINO\n\nVote prepara su pr\u00f3ximo cap\u00edtulo: una gran actualizaci\u00f3n llega en los pr\u00f3ximos meses, con encuestas y preguntas cara a cara. Mantente atento: lo que viene vale la pena.\n\n# EMITE TU VOTO\n\nEntra en Vote, el simulador de votaci\u00f3n VR gratuito para Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S y Pro. Sea cual sea la pregunta, elige tu bando, emite tu voto y sigue los resultados en tiempo real mientras el mundo vota contigo. No es solo deporte: es de todo. \u00a1Haz que tu voz cuente!\n\nLos votos v\u00e1lidos pueden reclamar un c\u00f3digo de descuento gratuito para un juego al final de la experiencia.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas principales:\n- Vota en preguntas cara a cara sobre todo tipo de temas\n- Sigue los resultados en tiempo real de t